inkpage (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Layers (PDF optional content groups): Layers page of the sidebar with
    show, print and active layer switches, create, rename, delete and
    order the layers; new drawings and inline texts go in the active
    layer; page backgrounds in a Background layer.
  * Eraser and stroke eraser, like Xournal++ (shapes are converted to ink).
  * Freehand pen: every mouse or tablet sample, smooth curve, ink
    annotation, the pen stays active.
  * Inline text: edited in place on double click, frame fits the text;
    font button and font window in the style toolbar.
  * Sidebar navigation toolbar, new icons (sticky notes, zoom, bookmarks,
    select table, layers, eraser).
  * French translation of the interface and of the messages.
  * Fixes: check marks of form check boxes (ZapfDingbats substitute font),
    the page content editor keeps the page background.

 -- Ludovic Mercier <ludovic@scilink.net>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:01:19 +0100

inkpage (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian package.
  * Menu cleanup, About dialog with the GPL-3+ license, new icons.
  * Page management toolbar (add, insert, duplicate, delete, move pages,
    ruled backgrounds), toolbars on the top or the right side.
  * Style toolbar with predefined colors and pen widths, Insert toolbar,
    image and highlighter tools, paste of text and images.

 -- Ludovic Mercier <ludovic@scilink.net>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0100
